    "description": "<p>A Solar who has achieved the apex of the Solar Hero Style transforms every unarmed blow into a demonstration of unstoppable mastery. Each successful unarmed attack by the Lawgiver automatically inflicts the Stunned effect upon its target and additionally applies a cumulative -2 internal penalty to the target, lasting for the duration of the scene. These penalties stack: a three-hit flurry imposes -6 internal penalty by the time the last blow lands. This Charm is Stackable; each additional purchase of Solar Hero Supremacy increases the penalty applied per hit by -2 (to -4 per hit on the second purchase, -6 per hit on the third, and so on).</p>",
